window.ESSAY_BOOK = {"sourceFile":"九下（2027春·网传版）写作任务原创范文·仅供教师参考","generatedAt":"2026-11-12","title":"九下（网传版）书面表达范文集","subtitle":"人教版（网传版）九年级下册 Unit 1 — Unit 5 · 学生请勿使用 · 仅供教师参考","stats":{"units":5,"essays":50,"patterns":40,"groupA":25,"groupB":25},"units":[{"no":1,"enName":"Let's Celebrate!","cnName":"一起庆祝吧","grammar":"简单句、并列句和复合句（Simple, Compound and Complex Sentences）","task":"Write a letter about your favourite festival（给朋友写信介绍自己最喜欢的节日）","patterns":[{"en":"I'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival.","cn":"我写信是想告诉你我最喜欢的节日。","usage":"书信开头点明写作目的，自然引出最喜欢的节日，常用于节日介绍类作文第一段。","search":"i'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival. 我写信是想告诉你我最喜欢的节日。 书信开头点明写作目的，自然引出最喜欢的节日，常用于节日介绍类作文第一段。"},{"en":"My favourite festival is the Spring Festival, which falls on the first day of the lunar year.","cn":"我最喜欢的节日是春节，它在农历正月初一。","usage":"用 which 引导的定语从句补充节日时间，是“简单句 + 从句”的复合句写法。","search":"my favourite festival is the spring festival, which falls on the first day of the lunar year. 我最喜欢的节日是春节，它在农历正月初一。 用 which 引导的定语从句补充节日时间，是“简单句 + 从句”的复合句写法。"},{"en":"Before the festival, my family clean the house and put up red couplets.","cn":"节前，我们全家打扫房子、贴红对联。","usage":"用 before 引出节前准备；clean ... and put up ... 是并列谓语，适合按时间顺序写习俗。","search":"before the festival, my family clean the house and put up red couplets. 节前，我们全家打扫房子、贴红对联。 用 before 引出节前准备；clean ... and put up ... 是并列谓语，适合按时间顺序写习俗。"},{"en":"On New Year's Eve, we have a big dinner together and watch the Spring Festival Gala.","cn":"除夕夜，我们一起吃年夜饭、看春节联欢晚会。","usage":"on + 具体节日晚上引出主要活动；and 连接两个动作，构成并列句。","search":"on new year's eve, we have a big dinner together and watch the spring festival gala. 除夕夜，我们一起吃年夜饭、看春节联欢晚会。 on + 具体节日晚上引出主要活动；and 连接两个动作，构成并列句。"},{"en":"I like the festival best because it brings the whole family together.","cn":"我最喜欢这个节日，因为它让全家人团聚在一起。","usage":"because 引导原因状语从句，说明喜欢的理由，是典型的复合句。","search":"i like the festival best because it brings the whole family together. 我最喜欢这个节日，因为它让全家人团聚在一起。 because 引导原因状语从句，说明喜欢的理由，是典型的复合句。"},{"en":"Although the festival is busy, everyone enjoys it very much.","cn":"虽然这个节日很忙碌，但大家都很享受。","usage":"although 引导让步状语从句，表示“虽然……但……”；注意英语中 although 不能与 but 连用。","search":"although the festival is busy, everyone enjoys it very much. 虽然这个节日很忙碌，但大家都很享受。 although 引导让步状语从句，表示“虽然……但……”；注意英语中 although 不能与 but 连用。"},{"en":"The festival is not only full of fun but also helps me understand our culture.","cn":"这个节日不仅充满乐趣，还帮助我了解我们的文化。","usage":"not only ... but also ... 连接两个并列成分，用于总结节日的意义。","search":"the festival is not only full of fun but also helps me understand our culture. 这个节日不仅充满乐趣，还帮助我了解我们的文化。 not only ... but also ... 连接两个并列成分，用于总结节日的意义。"},{"en":"Would you like to come and celebrate it with us next year?","cn":"你愿意明年和我们一起庆祝这个节日吗？","usage":"Would you like to ...? 用于书信结尾发出邀请，语气礼貌亲切。","search":"would you like to come and celebrate it with us next year? 你愿意明年和我们一起庆祝这个节日吗？ would you like to ...? 用于书信结尾发出邀请，语气礼貌亲切。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u1-a1","unit":1,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"给汤姆的一封信：我最喜欢的春节","enTitle":"A Letter to Tom About My Favourite Festival","words":"约118词","wordsApprox":118,"paragraphs":["Dear Tom, I'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival—the Spring Festival. It is the most important festival in China, and it falls on the first day of the Chinese lunar year.","Before the festival, my family clean the house and put up red couplets. On New Year's Eve, we have a big dinner together. Then we watch the Spring Festival Gala and stay up late. On the first morning, I get red packets from my parents, and we visit our relatives. I like the Spring Festival best because it brings the whole family together, and everyone is cheerful.","Would you like to come and celebrate it with us next year? I'm sure you will love it."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Dear Tom 称呼对方，I'm writing to tell you about... 点明写作目的，再用简单句说明节日的地位与时间，干净利落。2）主体按时间顺序写节前准备与节日当天的活动，Before the festival、On New Year's Eve、On the first morning 等时间状语层次清楚；clean...and put up... 是并列句，because it brings... 是复合句，句式有变化。3）结尾用 Would you like to... 发出邀请，并用 I'm sure... 表达期待，礼貌自然。","highlight":"I like the Spring Festival best because it brings the whole family together, and everyone is cheerful.","highlightCn":"我最喜欢春节，因为它让全家人团聚在一起，而且每个人都喜气洋洋。"},"translation":null,"search":"给汤姆的一封信：我最喜欢的春节 a letter to tom about my favourite festival dear tom, i'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival—the spring festival. it is the most important festival in china, and it falls on the first day of the chinese lunar year. before the festival, my family clean the house and put up red couplets. on new year's eve, we have a big dinner together. then we watch the spring festival gala and stay up late. on the first morning, i get red packets from my parents, and we visit our relatives. i like the spring festival best because it brings the whole family together, and everyone is cheerful. would you like to come and celebrate it with us next year? i'm sure you will love it."},{"id":"u1-a2","unit":1,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"给爱丽丝的一封信：我最喜欢的中秋节","enTitle":"A Letter to Alice About the Mid-Autumn Festival","words":"约111词","wordsApprox":111,"paragraphs":["Dear Alice, I'm writing to share my favourite festival with you—the Mid-Autumn Festival. It is celebrated on the fifteenth day of the eighth lunar month, when the moon is the fullest and brightest of the year.","On that evening, my family usually has a big dinner and then sits in the yard to admire the moon. We eat mooncakes, which are round and sweet, and my grandparents tell us the story of Chang'e. Although I love the mooncakes, what I enjoy most is staying with my family. The festival makes me feel warm and peaceful.","Do you have a moon festival in your country? I'd love to know more about it."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头直接点明最喜欢的节日是中秋节，并用 when 引导的定语从句说明月亮最圆最亮的时节，信息丰富。2）第二段先写吃晚饭、赏月，再用 which 引导的定语从句介绍月饼，最后把嫦娥的传说自然融入叙述，简单句与复合句交替使用。3）Although I love the mooncakes, what I enjoy most is staying with my family 用让步状语从句与主语从句形成对比，结尾用问句与对方互动，亲切自然。","highlight":"Although I love the mooncakes, what I enjoy most is staying with my family.","highlightCn":"虽然我喜欢月饼，但我最享受的是和家人待在一起。"},"translation":null,"search":"给爱丽丝的一封信：我最喜欢的中秋节 a letter to alice about the mid-autumn festival dear alice, i'm writing to share my favourite festival with you—the mid-autumn festival. it is celebrated on the fifteenth day of the eighth lunar month, when the moon is the fullest and brightest of the year. on that evening, my family usually has a big dinner and then sits in the yard to admire the moon. we eat mooncakes, which are round and sweet, and my grandparents tell us the story of chang'e. although i love the mooncakes, what i enjoy most is staying with my family. the festival makes me feel warm and peaceful. do you have a moon festival in your country? i'd love to know more about it."},{"id":"u1-a3","unit":1,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"给彼得的一封信：我最喜欢的端午节","enTitle":"A Letter to Peter About the Dragon Boat Festival","words":"约129词","wordsApprox":129,"paragraphs":["Dear Peter, How is everything going? I'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival, the Dragon Boat Festival. It takes place on the fifth day of the fifth lunar month, and it is famous for dragon boat races.","Early that morning, my mother hangs mugwort on our door, and my grandmother makes zongzi. Later we go to the river to watch the races. The boats are painted like dragons, and the teams row as hard as they can. I cheer loudly with my friends. Although the festival is exciting, I like it mainly because it reminds us of Qu Yuan, a great poet who loved his country.","If you visit China in early summer, you must try zongzi and watch a race. I'm sure you will enjoy them."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 How is everything going? 寒暄，I'm writing to tell you about... 点明目的，并说明端午节的时间与主要活动。2）主体写挂艾草、包粽子、看龙舟赛等习俗，my mother hangs... and my grandmother makes... 是并列句；Although the festival is exciting, I like it mainly because... 把让步状语从句与原因状语从句结合，突出纪念屈原的深层原因。3）结尾用 If you visit... 提出邀请，并用 I'm sure... 表达期待，首尾呼应。","highlight":"Although the festival is exciting, I like it mainly because it reminds us of Qu Yuan, a great poet who loved his country.","highlightCn":"虽然这个节日很热闹，但我喜欢它主要是因为它让我们想起屈原——一位热爱祖国的伟大诗人。"},"translation":null,"search":"给彼得的一封信：我最喜欢的端午节 a letter to peter about the dragon boat festival dear peter, how is everything going? i'm writing to tell you about my favourite festival, the dragon boat festival. it takes place on the fifth day of the fifth lunar month, and it is famous for dragon boat races. early that morning, my mother hangs mugwort on our door, and my grandmother makes zongzi. later we go to the river to watch the races. the boats are painted like dragons, and the teams row as hard as they can. i cheer loudly with my friends. although the festival is exciting, i like it mainly because it reminds us of qu yuan, a great poet who loved his country. if you visit china in early summer, you must try zongzi and watch a race. i'm sure you will enjoy them."},{"id":"u1-a4","unit":1,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"给露西的一封信：我最喜欢的元宵节","enTitle":"A Letter to Lucy About the Lantern Festival","words":"约118词","wordsApprox":118,"paragraphs":["Dear Lucy, I'm glad to tell you about my favourite festival—the Lantern Festival. It falls on the fifteenth day of the first lunar month and marks the end of the Chinese New Year celebrations.","On that day, my family make sweet dumplings together, and in the evening we go to the park to see different lanterns. The lanterns are in the shapes of animals and flowers, and they light up the night sky. Children carry small lanterns and guess lantern riddles with their parents. I like the festival because it is beautiful and full of laughter. My favourite moment is when we watch the fireworks together.","I hope you can enjoy this wonderful festival with me one day."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 I'm glad to tell you about... 表达分享的愉快心情，并用简单句说明元宵节的时间与意义。2）第二段按时间顺序写白天做汤圆、晚上看花灯、猜灯谜、看烟花，and、then 等连接词使叙事流畅，还用 in the shapes of... 描写花灯外形。3）My favourite moment is when we watch the fireworks together 用 when 引导表语从句写出最爱的瞬间，情感真挚；结尾直接发出邀请，呼应开头。","highlight":"My favourite moment is when we watch the fireworks together.","highlightCn":"我最喜欢的时刻是我们一起看烟花的那一瞬间。"},"translation":null,"search":"给露西的一封信：我最喜欢的元宵节 a letter to lucy about the lantern festival dear lucy, i'm glad to tell you about my favourite festival—the lantern festival. it falls on the fifteenth day of the first lunar month and marks the end of the chinese new year celebrations. on that day, my family make sweet dumplings together, and in the evening we go to the park to see different lanterns. the lanterns are in the shapes of animals and flowers, and they light up the night sky. children carry small lanterns and guess lantern riddles with their parents. i like the festival because it is beautiful and full of laughter. my favourite moment is when we watch the fireworks together. i hope you can enjoy this wonderful festival with me one day."},{"id":"u1-a5","unit":1,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"给迈克的一封信：我最喜欢的重阳节","enTitle":"A Letter to Mike About the Double Ninth Festival","words":"约116词","wordsApprox":116,"paragraphs":["Dear Mike, I'm writing to introduce my favourite festival, the Double Ninth Festival. It is celebrated on the ninth day of the ninth lunar month, so people also call it the Chongyang Festival.","On that day, my parents take me to climb a mountain near our city, and we enjoy the cool autumn air. Afterwards, we visit my grandparents and bring them presents. We eat double ninth cakes and drink chrysanthemum tea. I like this festival best because it teaches me to respect old people. Although the festival is not as lively as the Spring Festival, it is full of love and warmth.","What is your favourite festival? Please write and tell me about it soon."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头介绍重阳节的时间（the ninth day of the ninth lunar month）和别称，并用 so 引导结果句说明别称的由来。2）主体用 Afterwards、and 等连接词按顺序写爬山、看望祖父母、吃重阳糕、喝菊花茶，习俗描写具体。3）I like this festival best because it teaches me to respect old people 用原因状语从句点明深层意义；Although the festival is not as lively as..., it is full of love and warmth 用让步状语从句作对比，结尾以问句收束。","highlight":"I like this festival best because it teaches me to respect old people.","highlightCn":"我最喜欢这个节日，因为它教我要尊敬老人。"},"translation":null,"search":"给迈克的一封信：我最喜欢的重阳节 a letter to mike about the double ninth festival dear mike, i'm writing to introduce my favourite festival, the double ninth festival. it is celebrated on the ninth day of the ninth lunar month, so people also call it the chongyang festival. on that day, my parents take me to climb a mountain near our city, and we enjoy the cool autumn air. afterwards, we visit my grandparents and bring them presents. we eat double ninth cakes and drink chrysanthemum tea. i like this festival best because it teaches me to respect old people. although the festival is not as lively as the spring festival, it is full of love and warmth. what is your favourite festival? please write and tell me about it soon."},{"id":"u1-b1","unit":1,"group":"B","index":6,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"给安娜的一封信：清明节","enTitle":"A Letter to Anna About the Qingming Festival","words":"约81词","wordsApprox":81,"paragraphs":["Dear Anna, I'd like to tell you about Qingming, which is also called the Tomb-Sweeping Day. It usually comes in early April, when the weather turns warm and the trees turn green. On that day, my family visit our ancestors' tombs and clean them carefully. We also put flowers in front of the tombs. After that, we often fly kites and enjoy the spring sunshine. I like Qingming because it reminds me to remember and love my family. Yours, Li Hua."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的安娜：我想向你介绍清明节，它也被称为扫墓节。清明通常在四月初到来，那时天气转暖、树木变绿。那一天，我们一家人会去祖先的墓地，仔细地清扫。我们还会在墓前放上鲜花。之后，我们常常放风筝，享受春日的阳光。我喜欢清明，因为它提醒我要铭记并热爱我的家人。你的朋友，李华。","search":"给安娜的一封信：清明节 a letter to anna about the qingming festival dear anna, i'd like to tell you about qingming, which is also called the tomb-sweeping day. it usually comes in early april, when the weather turns warm and the trees turn green. on that day, my family visit our ancestors' tombs and clean them carefully. we also put flowers in front of the tombs. after that, we often fly kites and enjoy the spring sunshine. i like qingming because it reminds me to remember and love my family. yours, li hua."},{"id":"u1-b2","unit":1,"group":"B","index":7,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"给杰克的一封信：腊八节","enTitle":"A Letter to Jack About the Laba Festival","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Dear Jack, My favourite festival is the Laba Festival, which falls on the eighth day of the twelfth lunar month. On that morning, my mother cooks Laba porridge with rice, beans and nuts, and the whole family enjoy it together. People believe the porridge brings good luck and health. After breakfast, we often start buying things for the Spring Festival. I like Laba because it is the start of the New Year celebrations and it fills our home with warmth. Yours, Li Hua."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的杰克：我最喜欢的节日是腊八节，它在农历十二月初八。那天早上，妈妈用大米、豆子和坚果煮腊八粥，全家人一起享用。人们相信腊八粥能带来好运和健康。早饭之后，我们常常开始为春节采购年货。我喜欢腊八，因为它是新年庆祝的开始，也让家里充满温暖。你的朋友，李华。","search":"给杰克的一封信：腊八节 a letter to jack about the laba festival dear jack, my favourite festival is the laba festival, which falls on the eighth day of the twelfth lunar month. on that morning, my mother cooks laba porridge with rice, beans and nuts, and the whole family enjoy it together. people believe the porridge brings good luck and health. after breakfast, we often start buying things for the spring festival. i like laba because it is the start of the new year celebrations and it fills our home with warmth. yours, li hua."},{"id":"u1-b3","unit":1,"group":"B","index":8,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"给蒂娜的一封信：傣族泼水节","enTitle":"A Letter to Tina About the Water Splashing Festival","words":"约85词","wordsApprox":85,"paragraphs":["Dear Tina, I want to tell you about the Water Splashing Festival of the Dai people in Yunnan. It usually takes place in April and lasts for several days. It is one of the most important festivals for the Dai people. People splash water on each other in the streets, because they believe water can wash away bad luck and bring happiness. At night, they sing and dance together. I have never been there, but I hope to join it one day. Yours, Li Hua."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的蒂娜：我想向你介绍云南傣族的泼水节。泼水节通常在四月举行，持续好几天。它是傣族最重要的节日之一。人们在街上互相泼水，因为他们相信水能冲走厄运、带来幸福。晚上，他们一起唱歌跳舞。我从未去过那里，但我希望有一天能参加。你的朋友，李华。","search":"给蒂娜的一封信：傣族泼水节 a letter to tina about the water splashing festival dear tina, i want to tell you about the water splashing festival of the dai people in yunnan. it usually takes place in april and lasts for several days. it is one of the most important festivals for the dai people. people splash water on each other in the streets, because they believe water can wash away bad luck and bring happiness. at night, they sing and dance together. i have never been there, but i hope to join it one day. yours, li hua."},{"id":"u1-b4","unit":1,"group":"B","index":9,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"给露西的一封信：彝族火把节","enTitle":"A Letter to Lucy About the Torch Festival","words":"约85词","wordsApprox":85,"paragraphs":["Dear Lucy, I'd like to introduce the Torch Festival of the Yi people. It is usually celebrated in late June. It is a traditional festival with a long history. On that evening, people light big torches and walk around the fields. They sing old songs, dance hand in hand, and wish for a good harvest. I once watched the festival with my uncle, and it was amazing. I like it because it is full of energy and the people are very friendly. Yours, Li Hua."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的露西：我想介绍彝族的火把节。火把节通常在六月下旬庆祝，是一个有着悠久历史的传统节日。那天晚上，人们点燃大火把，绕着田野行走。他们唱着古老的歌，手拉手跳舞，祈求丰收。我曾和叔叔一起看过这个节日，那真是太棒了。我喜欢它，因为它充满活力，而且人们非常友好。你的朋友，李华。","search":"给露西的一封信：彝族火把节 a letter to lucy about the torch festival dear lucy, i'd like to introduce the torch festival of the yi people. it is usually celebrated in late june. it is a traditional festival with a long history. on that evening, people light big torches and walk around the fields. they sing old songs, dance hand in hand, and wish for a good harvest. i once watched the festival with my uncle, and it was amazing. i like it because it is full of energy and the people are very friendly. yours, li hua."},{"id":"u1-b5","unit":1,"group":"B","index":10,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"给迈克的一封信：七夕节","enTitle":"A Letter to Mike About the Double Seventh Festival","words":"约88词","wordsApprox":88,"paragraphs":["Dear Mike, My favourite festival is the Double Seventh Festival, which is also called Qixi. It falls on the seventh day of the seventh lunar month and is known as the Chinese Valentine's Day. On that night, people look up at the stars and tell the story of Niulang and Zhinü. It is a festival full of love and hope, and many young people give gifts to the ones they love. I like the festival because the story is moving and the night is beautiful. Yours, Li Hua."],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的迈克：我最喜欢的节日是七夕节，也叫乞巧节。它在农历七月初七，被称为中国的情人节。那天晚上，人们仰望星空，讲述牛郎和织女的故事。这是一个充满爱与希望的节日，许多年轻人送礼物给自己爱的人。我喜欢这个节日，因为它的故事很动人，夜色也很美。你的朋友，李华。","search":"给迈克的一封信：七夕节 a letter to mike about the double seventh festival dear mike, my favourite festival is the double seventh festival, which is also called qixi. it falls on the seventh day of the seventh lunar month and is known as the chinese valentine's day. on that night, people look up at the stars and tell the story of niulang and zhinü. it is a festival full of love and hope, and many young people give gifts to the ones they love. i like the festival because the story is moving and the night is beautiful. yours, li hua."}]},{"no":2,"enName":"A Look into the Past","cnName":"回望过去","grammar":"情态动词表推测（must / may / might / can't + have done / be）","task":"Write a presentation script about a historical object or site（写历史文物/遗址讲解稿）","patterns":[{"en":"Good morning, everyone. Today I'm going to talk about the Great Wall.","cn":"大家早上好。今天我要讲的是长城。","usage":"讲解稿开头先问候听众，再用 today I'm going to talk about... 点明主题，简洁明了。","search":"good morning, everyone. today i'm going to talk about the great wall. 大家早上好。今天我要讲的是长城。 讲解稿开头先问候听众，再用 today i'm going to talk about... 点明主题，简洁明了。"},{"en":"The Great Wall lies in the north of China and stretches thousands of kilometres.","cn":"长城位于中国北方，绵延数千公里。","usage":"用简单句加并列谓语介绍文物的位置与规模；lie in 表示“位于”。","search":"the great wall lies in the north of china and stretches thousands of kilometres. 长城位于中国北方，绵延数千公里。 用简单句加并列谓语介绍文物的位置与规模；lie in 表示“位于”。"},{"en":"It was built more than 2,000 years ago by thousands of workers.","cn":"它由成千上万的工匠在两千多年前建造。","usage":"一般过去时被动语态 was built 介绍建造时间与建造者，是说明文物的常用句式。","search":"it was built more than 2,000 years ago by thousands of workers. 它由成千上万的工匠在两千多年前建造。 一般过去时被动语态 was built 介绍建造时间与建造者，是说明文物的常用句式。"},{"en":"The workers must have worked very hard without modern machines.","cn":"没有现代机械，工匠们当时一定非常辛苦。","usage":"must have done 表示对过去情况的肯定推测，用于想象古代建造场景。","search":"the workers must have worked very hard without modern machines. 没有现代机械，工匠们当时一定非常辛苦。 must have done 表示对过去情况的肯定推测，用于想象古代建造场景。"},{"en":"The building may have been used for important ceremonies.","cn":"这座建筑过去可能被用于重要的仪式。","usage":"may have done 表示对过去情况的可能性推测；被动结构为 may have been done。","search":"the building may have been used for important ceremonies. 这座建筑过去可能被用于重要的仪式。 may have done 表示对过去情况的可能性推测；被动结构为 may have been done。"},{"en":"It can't have been easy to move such a heavy object.","cn":"移动这么重的物体一定非常不容易。","usage":"can't have done 表示“不可能做过某事”，用于强调难度之大，语气较强。","search":"it can't have been easy to move such a heavy object. 移动这么重的物体一定非常不容易。 can't have done 表示“不可能做过某事”，用于强调难度之大，语气较强。"},{"en":"The statues might have been made by craftsmen from different places.","cn":"这些雕像也许是来自不同地方的工匠制作的。","usage":"might have done 表示把握较小的推测，语气比 may 更委婉。","search":"the statues might have been made by craftsmen from different places. 这些雕像也许是来自不同地方的工匠制作的。 might have done 表示把握较小的推测，语气比 may 更委婉。"},{"en":"Thank you for listening. I hope you have learned something new today.","cn":"谢谢大家聆听。希望你们今天学到了新东西。","usage":"讲解稿结尾致谢并表达希望，自然收束，与开头的问候相呼应。","search":"thank you for listening. i hope you have learned something new today. 谢谢大家聆听。希望你们今天学到了新东西。 讲解稿结尾致谢并表达希望，自然收束，与开头的问候相呼应。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u2-a1","unit":2,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"长城讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Great Wall","words":"约139词","wordsApprox":139,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone. Today I'm going to talk about the Great Wall, one of the greatest wonders of the world. It lies in the north of China, and the most famous part is near Beijing.","The Great Wall was first built more than 2,000 years ago, and later dynasties rebuilt and extended it. The walls were made of stone and bricks, and they stretch thousands of kilometres across mountains and deserts. In the past, soldiers must have spent years guarding the wall, and they might have lived a hard life. The wall can't have been easy to build without modern machines, so we should admire the workers' wisdom and hard work.","Today the Great Wall attracts visitors from all over the world. When you stand on it, you may feel the long history of China. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Good morning, everyone. Today I'm going to talk about... 向听众问好并点明主题，符合讲解稿的文体要求。2）主体按时间顺序介绍长城的位置、修建年代和建造材料，was first built、were made 等被动语态客观准确；must have spent、might have lived 表示对古代生活的推测，can't have been easy 表示“不可能容易”，把建造场景写得具体可感。3）结尾从历史转到今天，用 When you stand on it, you may feel... 与听众互动，再用 Thank you for listening 收束。","highlight":"The wall can't have been easy to build without modern machines, so we should admire the workers' wisdom and hard work.","highlightCn":"没有现代机械，修建长城一定非常不容易，所以我们应该敬佩工匠们的智慧和辛勤劳动。"},"translation":null,"search":"长城讲解稿 a presentation script about the great wall good morning, everyone. today i'm going to talk about the great wall, one of the greatest wonders of the world. it lies in the north of china, and the most famous part is near beijing. the great wall was first built more than 2,000 years ago, and later dynasties rebuilt and extended it. the walls were made of stone and bricks, and they stretch thousands of kilometres across mountains and deserts. in the past, soldiers must have spent years guarding the wall, and they might have lived a hard life. the wall can't have been easy to build without modern machines, so we should admire the workers' wisdom and hard work. today the great wall attracts visitors from all over the world. when you stand on it, you may feel the long history of china. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-a2","unit":2,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"兵马俑讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Terracotta Army","words":"约122词","wordsApprox":122,"paragraphs":["Hello, everyone. My presentation is about the Terracotta Army in Xi'an. It is one of the most amazing discoveries in the world.","The Terracotta Army was found by farmers in 1974. They were digging a well when they hit some clay pieces. Later, experts found thousands of life-size clay soldiers, horses and chariots in the ground. Each soldier has a different face, so they can't have been made by one person. The workers must have needed great skill to finish them, and the army may have been built to protect the first emperor after his death.","The Terracotta Army shows us the power and the art of ancient China. I'm sure you will be surprised if you see it. Thanks for listening."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Hello, everyone. My presentation is about... 直接点明主题，并用简单句评价兵马俑的地位。2）主体先叙述 1974 年被农民发现的经过，was found 用被动语态交代事实；再用 can't have been made、must have needed、may have been built 三个情态动词推测句，从“不可能是一个人做的”“一定需要高超技艺”“可能是为保护秦始皇而建”层层推进，推断合理。3）结尾用 shows us... 总结意义，并用 I'm sure... 与听众互动，收束自然。","highlight":"Each soldier has a different face, so they can't have been made by one person.","highlightCn":"每名士兵的面容都不一样，所以它们不可能是同一个人制作的。"},"translation":null,"search":"兵马俑讲解稿 a presentation script about the terracotta army hello, everyone. my presentation is about the terracotta army in xi'an. it is one of the most amazing discoveries in the world. the terracotta army was found by farmers in 1974. they were digging a well when they hit some clay pieces. later, experts found thousands of life-size clay soldiers, horses and chariots in the ground. each soldier has a different face, so they can't have been made by one person. the workers must have needed great skill to finish them, and the army may have been built to protect the first emperor after his death. the terracotta army shows us the power and the art of ancient china. i'm sure you will be surprised if you see it. thanks for listening."},{"id":"u2-a3","unit":2,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"故宫讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Forbidden City","words":"约124词","wordsApprox":124,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone. Today I'd like to introduce the Forbidden City, the largest old palace in the world. It lies in the centre of Beijing.","The Forbidden City was built in the early 15th century, and it was the home of 24 emperors. It has more than 9,000 rooms, and its walls and roofs are painted in rich colours. The workers must have worked day and night for years to finish it. The emperor might have watched ceremonies from the highest hall, and ordinary people couldn't enter it in the past.","Today it is a museum that welcomes visitors from all over the world. When you walk through its gates, you may feel that you have travelled back in time. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Good morning, everyone. Today I'd like to introduce... 问候并点明主题，介绍故宫的地位和位置。2）主体用 was built、was the home of 交代历史，再用 must have worked day and night、might have watched、couldn't enter 等推测与过去式表达，把工匠的辛劳与皇帝的生活写得立体可感；简单句、并列句交替出现。3）结尾用 When you walk through its gates, you may feel... 把历史与现实连接，并致谢收尾。","highlight":"The workers must have worked day and night for years to finish it.","highlightCn":"工匠们当年一定是夜以继日地干了很多年才把它建成。"},"translation":null,"search":"故宫讲解稿 a presentation script about the forbidden city good morning, everyone. today i'd like to introduce the forbidden city, the largest old palace in the world. it lies in the centre of beijing. the forbidden city was built in the early 15th century, and it was the home of 24 emperors. it has more than 9,000 rooms, and its walls and roofs are painted in rich colours. the workers must have worked day and night for years to finish it. the emperor might have watched ceremonies from the highest hall, and ordinary people couldn't enter it in the past. today it is a museum that welcomes visitors from all over the world. when you walk through its gates, you may feel that you have travelled back in time. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-a4","unit":2,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"莫高窟讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Mogao Caves","words":"约111词","wordsApprox":111,"paragraphs":["Hello, everyone. My topic today is the Mogao Caves in Dunhuang, Gansu. They are famous for their beautiful wall paintings and statues.","The Mogao Caves were first built over 1,600 years ago. Over the centuries, artists kept cutting caves into the rock and painting pictures of daily life and religion. The paintings must have taken a long time to finish, and the artists may have learned from each other. Their colours are still bright today, so they can't have been made with poor materials.","The Mogao Caves are a treasure of Chinese art and history. If you are interested in art, you should visit them one day. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Hello, everyone. My topic today is... 点明主题，并一句话说明莫高窟闻名之处。2）主体按时间顺序介绍开凿历史与绘画内容，kept cutting... and painting... 用并列结构表现持续的动作；must have taken、may have learned 推测创作过程，can't have been made 从颜料至今鲜艳推断材料上乘，逻辑严密。3）结尾用 If you are interested in art, you should visit... 提出建议，并致谢收束。","highlight":"Their colours are still bright today, so they can't have been made with poor materials.","highlightCn":"它们的颜色至今仍然鲜艳，所以不可能是用劣质材料画成的。"},"translation":null,"search":"莫高窟讲解稿 a presentation script about the mogao caves hello, everyone. my topic today is the mogao caves in dunhuang, gansu. they are famous for their beautiful wall paintings and statues. the mogao caves were first built over 1,600 years ago. over the centuries, artists kept cutting caves into the rock and painting pictures of daily life and religion. the paintings must have taken a long time to finish, and the artists may have learned from each other. their colours are still bright today, so they can't have been made with poor materials. the mogao caves are a treasure of chinese art and history. if you are interested in art, you should visit them one day. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-a5","unit":2,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"大运河讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Grand Canal","words":"约117词","wordsApprox":117,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone. Today I'm going to tell you about the Grand Canal, the longest man-made waterway in the world. It runs from Beijing to Hangzhou.","The Grand Canal was built over 2,000 years ago, and it connects several rivers and cities. In the past, boats carried food and goods along it, and they kept the country alive. The canal has a long and important history. The workers must have had a hard time digging it by hand. People today may not know that the canal is still important, because it carries water and ships.","The Grand Canal shows the wisdom of the Chinese people. I hope you have learned something new today. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Good morning, everyone. Today I'm going to tell you about... 点明主题，并用简单句说明大运河的地位与走向。2）主体介绍修建年代和运输作用，was built、connects 简洁准确；must have had a hard time digging it by hand 用 must have done 推测工匠的艰辛，People today may not know... 用 may not 提示人们可能不了解的现实，情态动词使用自然。3）结尾用 shows the wisdom... 总结意义，并以 I hope... 和致谢收束。","highlight":"The workers must have had a hard time digging it by hand.","highlightCn":"工匠们当年仅靠双手开凿大运河，一定吃了不少苦。"},"translation":null,"search":"大运河讲解稿 a presentation script about the grand canal good morning, everyone. today i'm going to tell you about the grand canal, the longest man-made waterway in the world. it runs from beijing to hangzhou. the grand canal was built over 2,000 years ago, and it connects several rivers and cities. in the past, boats carried food and goods along it, and they kept the country alive. the canal has a long and important history. the workers must have had a hard time digging it by hand. people today may not know that the canal is still important, because it carries water and ships. the grand canal shows the wisdom of the chinese people. i hope you have learned something new today. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-b1","unit":2,"group":"B","index":6,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"颐和园讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Summer Palace","words":"约86词","wordsApprox":86,"paragraphs":["Hello, everyone. Today I'd like to talk about the Summer Palace in Beijing. It was built about 300 years ago, and it was a garden for the emperors. The beautiful lake and the long corridor are my favourite parts. The emperors must have enjoyed walking here in summer. The builders can't have finished it in a short time. Today it is a park that everyone can visit. It is a symbol of Chinese garden art, and many visitors come here every year. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家好。今天我想谈谈北京的颐和园。它大约建于 300 年前，曾是皇帝们的园林。美丽的湖和长廊是我最喜欢的部分。皇帝们当年一定很喜欢夏天在这里散步。建造者们不可能在短时间内把它建成。今天它是每个人都能游览的公园。它是中国园林艺术的象征，每年都有许多游客来这里。谢谢大家聆听。","search":"颐和园讲解稿 a presentation script about the summer palace hello, everyone. today i'd like to talk about the summer palace in beijing. it was built about 300 years ago, and it was a garden for the emperors. the beautiful lake and the long corridor are my favourite parts. the emperors must have enjoyed walking here in summer. the builders can't have finished it in a short time. today it is a park that everyone can visit. it is a symbol of chinese garden art, and many visitors come here every year. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-b2","unit":2,"group":"B","index":7,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"布达拉宫讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Potala Palace","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone. My topic is the Potala Palace in Lhasa, Tibet. It stands on a high hill, and it was once the home of the Dalai Lama. It is one of the most famous buildings in the world. The building is huge, and its walls are white and red. The workers must have carried heavy stones up the hill, and the views from the top may be the best in the city. It is a symbol of Tibet. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家早上好。我今天的主题是西藏拉萨的布达拉宫。它矗立在高高的山丘上，曾是达赖喇嘛的住所，是世界上著名的建筑之一。这座建筑非常巨大，墙壁是白红两色的。工匠们当年一定是把沉重的石头运上了山，从山顶看到的景色也许是全城最好的。它是西藏的象征。谢谢大家聆听。","search":"布达拉宫讲解稿 a presentation script about the potala palace good morning, everyone. my topic is the potala palace in lhasa, tibet. it stands on a high hill, and it was once the home of the dalai lama. it is one of the most famous buildings in the world. the building is huge, and its walls are white and red. the workers must have carried heavy stones up the hill, and the views from the top may be the best in the city. it is a symbol of tibet. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-b3","unit":2,"group":"B","index":8,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"黄鹤楼讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Yellow Crane Tower","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Hello, everyone. Today I want to introduce the Yellow Crane Tower in Wuhan. It is one of the most famous towers in China, and many old poems were written about it. It has a long history. The tower we see today was rebuilt not long ago. The first tower may have been built more than 1,000 years ago, and it must have been a great place for poets to gather. Visitors can enjoy the view of the Yangtze River. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家好。今天我想介绍武汉的黄鹤楼。它是中国最著名的楼阁之一，许多古诗都是为它而写的，它有着悠久的历史。我们今天看到的黄鹤楼是不久前重建的。最早的黄鹤楼也许建于一千多年前，它当年一定曾是诗人们聚会的好地方。游客可以欣赏长江的景色。谢谢大家聆听。","search":"黄鹤楼讲解稿 a presentation script about the yellow crane tower hello, everyone. today i want to introduce the yellow crane tower in wuhan. it is one of the most famous towers in china, and many old poems were written about it. it has a long history. the tower we see today was rebuilt not long ago. the first tower may have been built more than 1,000 years ago, and it must have been a great place for poets to gather. visitors can enjoy the view of the yangtze river. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-b4","unit":2,"group":"B","index":9,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"后母戊鼎讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Houmuwu Ding","words":"约81词","wordsApprox":81,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone. My presentation is about an ancient bronze ding called the Houmuwu Ding. It was found in Henan, and it is one of the largest bronze vessels in the world. It is a great treasure of Chinese history. The workers must have needed a lot of skill to make it. The emperor might have used it to honor his mother. It can't have been easy to move. Today it is in a museum in Beijing. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家早上好。我的讲解介绍的是一件叫后母戊鼎的古代青铜鼎。它出土于河南，是世界上最大的青铜器之一，是中国历史上一件伟大的宝物。工匠们制作它当年一定需要高超的技艺。商王可能用它来纪念他的母亲。要移动它一定非常不容易。今天它收藏在北京的一家博物馆里。谢谢大家聆听。","search":"后母戊鼎讲解稿 a presentation script about the houmuwu ding good morning, everyone. my presentation is about an ancient bronze ding called the houmuwu ding. it was found in henan, and it is one of the largest bronze vessels in the world. it is a great treasure of chinese history. the workers must have needed a lot of skill to make it. the emperor might have used it to honor his mother. it can't have been easy to move. today it is in a museum in beijing. thank you for listening."},{"id":"u2-b5","unit":2,"group":"B","index":10,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"龙门石窟讲解稿","enTitle":"A Presentation Script About the Longmen Grottoes","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Hello, everyone. Today I'd like to talk about the Longmen Grottoes in Luoyang, Henan. They are hundreds of caves with thousands of stone statues of Buddha. It is a symbol of Chinese art. People started to cut them about 1,500 years ago. The statues are different in size, and each one has a special expression. The craftsmen must have been very patient, and the project may have taken hundreds of years. Today it is a famous place for tourists. Thank you for listening."],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家好。今天我想谈谈河南洛阳的龙门石窟。它们是数百个洞窟，里面有成千上万尊石佛，是中国艺术的象征。人们大约在 1500 年前开始开凿它们。这些佛像大小不同，每一尊都有特别的神情。工匠们当年一定非常有耐心，这项工程也许花了几百年。今天它是著名的旅游胜地。谢谢大家聆听。","search":"龙门石窟讲解稿 a presentation script about the longmen grottoes hello, everyone. today i'd like to talk about the longmen grottoes in luoyang, henan. they are hundreds of caves with thousands of stone statues of buddha. it is a symbol of chinese art. people started to cut them about 1,500 years ago. the statues are different in size, and each one has a special expression. the craftsmen must have been very patient, and the project may have taken hundreds of years. today it is a famous place for tourists. thank you for listening."}]},{"no":3,"enName":"A Taste of Art","cnName":"品味艺术","grammar":"不定式作宾语、状语和宾语补足语","task":"Write a short introduction to an artist（写一位艺术家的简介）","patterns":[{"en":"… is one of the most famous artists in the world.","cn":"……是世界上最著名的艺术家之一。","usage":"介绍艺术家时用于开头点明身份，one of the most famous + 名词复数 表示“最……之一”，后文再按时间顺序展开生平。","search":"… is one of the most famous artists in the world. ……是世界上最著名的艺术家之一。 介绍艺术家时用于开头点明身份，one of the most famous + 名词复数 表示“最……之一”，后文再按时间顺序展开生平。"},{"en":"He was born in 1881 in Spain and showed great interest in drawing when he was young.","cn":"他 1881 年出生在西班牙，小时候就对画画表现出很大的兴趣。","usage":"was born in + 年份/地点 交代出生信息；show great interest in 表示“对……表现出浓厚兴趣”，是简介类作文的常用功能句。","search":"he was born in 1881 in spain and showed great interest in drawing when he was young. 他 1881 年出生在西班牙，小时候就对画画表现出很大的兴趣。 was born in + 年份/地点 交代出生信息；show great interest in 表示“对……表现出浓厚兴趣”，是简介类作文的常用功能句。"},{"en":"He decided to become a painter when he was only ten years old.","cn":"他十岁时就决定要成为一名画家。","usage":"decide to do sth. 中不定式作宾语，用“决定做某事”交代人物志向；when 引导时间状语从句。","search":"he decided to become a painter when he was only ten years old. 他十岁时就决定要成为一名画家。 decide to do sth. 中不定式作宾语，用“决定做某事”交代人物志向；when 引导时间状语从句。"},{"en":"He went to Paris to learn art from famous teachers.","cn":"他去巴黎向名师学习艺术。","usage":"不定式 to learn 作目的状语，说明去某地的目的；learn sth. from sb. 表示“向某人学习”。","search":"he went to paris to learn art from famous teachers. 他去巴黎向名师学习艺术。 不定式 to learn 作目的状语，说明去某地的目的；learn sth. from sb. 表示“向某人学习”。"},{"en":"His teacher encouraged him to try new ways of painting.","cn":"他的老师鼓励他尝试新的绘画方式。","usage":"encourage sb. to do sth. 中不定式作宾语补足语；try new ways of doing sth. 表达“尝试做某事的新方法”。","search":"his teacher encouraged him to try new ways of painting. 他的老师鼓励他尝试新的绘画方式。 encourage sb. to do sth. 中不定式作宾语补足语；try new ways of doing sth. 表达“尝试做某事的新方法”。"},{"en":"It is not easy to create a great painting, but he never gave up.","cn":"创作一幅伟大的画作并不容易，但他从未放弃。","usage":"It is + 形容词 + to do sth. 中 it 是形式主语，不定式是真正的主语；but 连接转折分句。","search":"it is not easy to create a great painting, but he never gave up. 创作一幅伟大的画作并不容易，但他从未放弃。 it is + 形容词 + to do sth. 中 it 是形式主语，不定式是真正的主语；but 连接转折分句。"},{"en":"His paintings encourage people to love life and to look at the world in a new way.","cn":"他的画作鼓励人们热爱生活，并以新的方式看待世界。","usage":"encourage sb. to do sth. 中两个不定式并列作宾语补足语；look at... in a new way 表示“以新的方式看待”。","search":"his paintings encourage people to love life and to look at the world in a new way. 他的画作鼓励人们热爱生活，并以新的方式看待世界。 encourage sb. to do sth. 中两个不定式并列作宾语补足语；look at... in a new way 表示“以新的方式看待”。"},{"en":"I hope to become an artist like him one day.","cn":"我希望有一天能成为像他一样的艺术家。","usage":"hope to do sth. 中不定式作宾语，用于结尾表达自己的愿望，呼应写作任务。","search":"i hope to become an artist like him one day. 我希望有一天能成为像他一样的艺术家。 hope to do sth. 中不定式作宾语，用于结尾表达自己的愿望，呼应写作任务。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u3-a1","unit":3,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"毕加索：不断创新的画家","enTitle":"Picasso: A Painter Who Never Stopped Creating","words":"约133词","wordsApprox":133,"paragraphs":["Pablo Picasso is one of the most famous artists in the world. He was born in 1881 in Spain and showed great interest in drawing when he was young. His father was an art teacher, so he grew up with brushes and paint around him.","Picasso decided to become a painter when he was only ten, and later he went to Paris to learn art. He never stopped trying new ways of painting. Together with his friend Braque, he created Cubism, which changed modern art. His most famous painting, Guernica, was painted in 1937 and shows the pain of war.","His paintings encourage people to look at the world in new ways. I hope to become an artist like him one day, and I believe that art can make our life more colourful."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Pablo Picasso is one of the most famous artists in the world 点明人物身份，再用 was born in 1881 in Spain 交代出生信息，His father was an art teacher 补充成长环境，让读者一开始就了解这位画家。2）主体按“少年立志—赴巴黎学习—创立立体主义—代表作《格尔尼卡》”的时间顺序展开：decided to become a painter 中不定式作宾语，went to Paris to learn art 中不定式作目的状语，created Cubism 点出艺术贡献，was painted in 1937 and shows the pain of war 交代作品主题。3）结尾用 encourage people to look at the world in new ways 评价其影响，再用 I hope to become... 和 I believe that... 表达自己的愿望，收束自然、紧扣题目。","highlight":"His paintings encourage people to look at the world in new ways.","highlightCn":"他的画作鼓励人们以新的方式看待世界。"},"translation":null,"search":"毕加索：不断创新的画家 picasso: a painter who never stopped creating pablo picasso is one of the most famous artists in the world. he was born in 1881 in spain and showed great interest in drawing when he was young. his father was an art teacher, so he grew up with brushes and paint around him. picasso decided to become a painter when he was only ten, and later he went to paris to learn art. he never stopped trying new ways of painting. together with his friend braque, he created cubism, which changed modern art. his most famous painting, guernica, was painted in 1937 and shows the pain of war. his paintings encourage people to look at the world in new ways. i hope to become an artist like him one day, and i believe that art can make our life more colourful."},{"id":"u3-a2","unit":3,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"徐悲鸿与他的奔马","enTitle":"Xu Beihong and His Running Horses","words":"约128词","wordsApprox":128,"paragraphs":["Xu Beihong is one of the greatest painters in China. He was born in 1895 in Jiangsu. His father was a painter, so he learned to draw when he was very young. He was so poor that he often used paper from old books to practise.","In 1919, he went to France to study art. There he learned how to put Western skills into Chinese ink painting. He loved horses, and he spent years watching them and drawing them. In his works, the horses are strong and full of life, and they seem to run out of the paper.","His paintings encourage people to keep going when life is hard. As a Chinese student, I hope to learn from him and to bring Chinese art to the world."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头先定位人物：one of the greatest painters in China，再用 was born in 1895 in Jiangsu 交代出生信息；His father was a painter, so he learned to draw 用 so 连接因果关系，解释他为何从小接触绘画。2）主体写两件事：一是 In 1919, he went to France to study art，不定式作目的状语；二是他爱马、观察马、画马的过程，the horses are strong and full of life 用形容词和短语描写作品特点，seem to run out of the paper 更把静态的画写活了。3）结尾用 encourage people to keep going 点明作品的精神力量，再以 As a Chinese student, I hope to learn from him 回到自身，突出“简介 + 感受”的写作思路。","highlight":"His paintings encourage people to keep going when life is hard.","highlightCn":"他的画作鼓励人们在生活艰难时坚持下去。"},"translation":null,"search":"徐悲鸿与他的奔马 xu beihong and his running horses xu beihong is one of the greatest painters in china. he was born in 1895 in jiangsu. his father was a painter, so he learned to draw when he was very young. he was so poor that he often used paper from old books to practise. in 1919, he went to france to study art. there he learned how to put western skills into chinese ink painting. he loved horses, and he spent years watching them and drawing them. in his works, the horses are strong and full of life, and they seem to run out of the paper. his paintings encourage people to keep going when life is hard. as a chinese student, i hope to learn from him and to bring chinese art to the world."},{"id":"u3-a3","unit":3,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"莫奈与他的花园","enTitle":"Monet and His Garden","words":"约131词","wordsApprox":131,"paragraphs":["Claude Monet is one of the most famous French painters. He was born in 1840 in Paris. When he was a boy, he loved to draw funny pictures of his teachers and friends. His mother supported him and told him to keep drawing.","In 1874, Monet and some friends held a show in Paris. A critic laughed at his painting Impression, Sunrise and called the group “Impressionists”. The name stayed, and Monet became the leader of this new style. He liked to paint outdoors, so he built a beautiful garden at Giverny and painted the same ponds and flowers again and again to catch the changing light.","His Water Lilies are loved by people all over the world. Monet shows us that beauty is everywhere if we take time to look."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 one of the most famous French painters 点明身份，was born in 1840 in Paris 交代出生信息，再写他小时候喜欢画老师和朋友的“搞笑画”，人物形象亲切自然。2）主体按“1874 年办展—被评论家嘲笑—成为印象派领袖—打造吉维尼花园”的顺序展开：A critic laughed at... and called the group “Impressionists” 交代“印象派”名称的由来，painted the same ponds and flowers again and again to catch the changing light 中不定式作目的状语，写出他追求光影的特点。3）结尾由名作 Water Lilies 过渡到感受：beauty is everywhere if we take time to look，用 if 条件句点明启示，收束简洁有力。","highlight":"Monet shows us that beauty is everywhere if we take time to look.","highlightCn":"莫奈告诉我们：只要花时间去观察，美就在我们身边。"},"translation":null,"search":"莫奈与他的花园 monet and his garden claude monet is one of the most famous french painters. he was born in 1840 in paris. when he was a boy, he loved to draw funny pictures of his teachers and friends. his mother supported him and told him to keep drawing. in 1874, monet and some friends held a show in paris. a critic laughed at his painting impression, sunrise and called the group “impressionists”. the name stayed, and monet became the leader of this new style. he liked to paint outdoors, so he built a beautiful garden at giverny and painted the same ponds and flowers again and again to catch the changing light. his water lilies are loved by people all over the world. monet shows us that beauty is everywhere if we take time to look."},{"id":"u3-a4","unit":3,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"弗里达·卡罗：用画笔记录人生","enTitle":"Frida Kahlo: Painting Her Life","words":"约133词","wordsApprox":133,"paragraphs":["Frida Kahlo is one of the most famous painters from Mexico. She was born in 1907. When she was six, she got ill and had to stay in bed for months. Her father gave her pencils and paper, and she started to draw to pass the time.","When she was eighteen, she was badly hurt in a bus accident. To forget the pain, she began to paint in bed. Her mother put a mirror above her bed so that she could see herself. From then on, she painted many self-portraits. She once said, “I paint my own reality.” Her paintings are full of bright colours and strong feelings.","Today her works are shown in museums around the world. Her story teaches us to be brave and to face difficulties with a strong heart."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 one of the most famous painters from Mexico 点明身份，was born in 1907 交代出生年份；When she was six, she got ill and had to stay in bed 用 when 时间状语从句讲述童年经历，gave her pencils and paper 交代她开始画画的缘由。2）主体写十八岁遭遇车祸后 begin to paint in bed，To forget the pain 中不定式作目的状语；her mother put a mirror above her bed so that she could see herself 用 so that 目的状语从句解释她为什么画自画像，bright colours and strong feelings 概括作品风格。3）结尾用 teaches us to be brave and to face difficulties 中两个不定式作宾语补足语，把人物故事与自己的感悟结合起来，升华主题。","highlight":"Her story teaches us to be brave and to face difficulties with a strong heart.","highlightCn":"她的故事教会我们勇敢，用坚强的心面对困难。"},"translation":null,"search":"弗里达·卡罗：用画笔记录人生 frida kahlo: painting her life frida kahlo is one of the most famous painters from mexico. she was born in 1907. when she was six, she got ill and had to stay in bed for months. her father gave her pencils and paper, and she started to draw to pass the time. when she was eighteen, she was badly hurt in a bus accident. to forget the pain, she began to paint in bed. her mother put a mirror above her bed so that she could see herself. from then on, she painted many self-portraits. she once said, “i paint my own reality.” her paintings are full of bright colours and strong feelings. today her works are shown in museums around the world. her story teaches us to be brave and to face difficulties with a strong heart."},{"id":"u3-a5","unit":3,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"我的姑姑：一位剪纸艺术家","enTitle":"My Aunt: A Paper-Cutting Artist","words":"约140词","wordsApprox":140,"paragraphs":["When people ask me who my favourite artist is, I always think of my aunt. She is not famous, but she is a wonderful paper-cutting artist in my town. She learned the skill from my grandmother when she was a little girl.","Every Spring Festival, my aunt decides to cut new pictures for our family. She uses red paper and a small pair of scissors. To make a picture of a rabbit, she first draws it on the paper. Then she cuts it carefully for hours. She often asks me to help her put the finished pictures on the windows. She wants to pass the old art on to young people.","Last year, I asked her to teach me paper cutting. She smiled and told me to be patient. Now I hope to make a beautiful picture for her birthday."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用设问 When people ask me who my favourite artist is 引出人物：my aunt 虽不著名，却是 wonderful paper-cutting artist，learned the skill from my grandmother 交代学艺经历，视角亲切、贴近生活。2）主体写她春节前 cut new pictures：decides to cut、uses red paper、draws it on the paper、cuts it carefully for hours，一系列动词按操作顺序展开，画面感强；asks me to help her 中不定式作宾语补足语，wants to pass the old art on to young people 点出她的心愿。3）结尾写我请她教我剪纸，told me to be patient 中不定式作宾语补足语，再用 I hope to make a beautiful picture 收束，全文以“我”的视角写人，感情真挚。","highlight":"She wants to pass the old art on to young people.","highlightCn":"她想把这门古老的艺术传给年轻人。"},"translation":null,"search":"我的姑姑：一位剪纸艺术家 my aunt: a paper-cutting artist when people ask me who my favourite artist is, i always think of my aunt. she is not famous, but she is a wonderful paper-cutting artist in my town. she learned the skill from my grandmother when she was a little girl. every spring festival, my aunt decides to cut new pictures for our family. she uses red paper and a small pair of scissors. to make a picture of a rabbit, she first draws it on the paper. then she cuts it carefully for hours. she often asks me to help her put the finished pictures on the windows. she wants to pass the old art on to young people. last year, i asked her to teach me paper cutting. she smiled and told me to be patient. now i hope to make a beautiful picture for her birthday."},{"id":"u3-b1","unit":3,"group":"B","index":6,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"文森特·凡·高","enTitle":"Vincent van Gogh","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Vincent van Gogh was a famous Dutch painter. He was born in 1853. He started to paint when he was about twenty-seven, and he painted more than 800 works in only ten years.","His most famous paintings are Sunflowers and The Starry Night. He used bright colours and thick paint to show how he felt. Today his works are shown in the best museums in the world.","He hoped to give people joy through art. Now people can see his dream come true."],"analysis":null,"translation":"文森特·凡·高是荷兰著名画家。他出生于 1853 年。他大约二十七岁才开始画画，可是仅用十年就画了 800 多幅作品。他最著名的画是《向日葵》和《星月夜》。他用明亮的色彩和厚重的颜料表达自己的感受。如今，他的作品在世界最好的博物馆里展出。他希望通过艺术给人们带来快乐。现在，人们可以看到他的梦想成真。","search":"文森特·凡·高 vincent van gogh vincent van gogh was a famous dutch painter. he was born in 1853. he started to paint when he was about twenty-seven, and he painted more than 800 works in only ten years. his most famous paintings are sunflowers and the starry night. he used bright colours and thick paint to show how he felt. today his works are shown in the best museums in the world. he hoped to give people joy through art. now people can see his dream come true."},{"id":"u3-b2","unit":3,"group":"B","index":7,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇","enTitle":"Leonardo da Vinci","words":"约86词","wordsApprox":86,"paragraphs":["Leonardo da Vinci is one of the greatest artists in history. He was born in Italy in 1452. He was not only a painter but also a scientist and an inventor.","His paintings Mona Lisa and The Last Supper are loved by people all over the world. He also filled many notebooks with drawings of flying machines and plants. He liked to watch and study everything carefully.","Leonardo showed us that curiosity can lead to great ideas. Today his notebooks still inspire people to learn more."],"analysis":null,"translation":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇是历史上最伟大的艺术家之一。他 1452 年出生在意大利。他不仅是画家，还是科学家和发明家。他的画作《蒙娜丽莎》和《最后的晚餐》深受世界各地人们的喜爱。他还用许多笔记本画满了飞行器和植物。他喜欢仔细观察和研究一切事物。达·芬奇告诉我们：好奇心能带来伟大的想法。今天，他的笔记仍然激励人们去学习更多知识。","search":"列奥纳多·达·芬奇 leonardo da vinci leonardo da vinci is one of the greatest artists in history. he was born in italy in 1452. he was not only a painter but also a scientist and an inventor. his paintings mona lisa and the last supper are loved by people all over the world. he also filled many notebooks with drawings of flying machines and plants. he liked to watch and study everything carefully. leonardo showed us that curiosity can lead to great ideas. today his notebooks still inspire people to learn more."},{"id":"u3-b3","unit":3,"group":"B","index":8,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"草间弥生：波点的世界","enTitle":"Yayoi Kusama: A World of Dots","words":"约87词","wordsApprox":87,"paragraphs":["Yayoi Kusama is a famous Japanese artist. She was born in 1929. When she was a child, she began to see the world as a sea of dots.","She came to the United States in 1957 to follow her dream. Her works are full of colourful dots and big pumpkins. She has worked for more than eighty years and has never stopped creating.","Many young fans love her because her art makes them feel happy. Kusama tells us to keep creating no matter how old we are."],"analysis":null,"translation":"草间弥生是日本著名艺术家。她出生于 1929 年。小时候，她开始把世界看作一片波点的海洋。1957 年，她为了追寻梦想来到美国。她的作品充满了色彩缤纷的波点和巨大的南瓜。她创作了八十多年，从未停止过艺术创作。许多年轻粉丝喜欢她，因为她的艺术让他们感到快乐。草间弥生告诉我们：无论多大年纪，都要坚持创作。","search":"草间弥生：波点的世界 yayoi kusama: a world of dots yayoi kusama is a famous japanese artist. she was born in 1929. when she was a child, she began to see the world as a sea of dots. she came to the united states in 1957 to follow her dream. her works are full of colourful dots and big pumpkins. she has worked for more than eighty years and has never stopped creating. many young fans love her because her art makes them feel happy. kusama tells us to keep creating no matter how old we are."},{"id":"u3-b4","unit":3,"group":"B","index":9,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"齐白石画虾","enTitle":"Qi Baishi and His Shrimp","words":"约99词","wordsApprox":99,"paragraphs":["Qi Baishi was one of the most famous painters in modern China. He was born in 1864 in a small village in Hunan. He did not go to art school, and he learned to paint by himself.","Qi Baishi was famous for his ink paintings of shrimp and flowers. He spent a long time watching shrimp in water, so his paintings look very alive. He loved simple things in everyday life and turned them into art.","He painted almost every day until his old age. His story tells us that hard work and love can make anyone an artist."],"analysis":null,"translation":"齐白石是中国现代最著名的画家之一。他 1864 年出生在湖南的一个小村庄。他没有上过美术学校，是自学画画的。齐白石以画虾和花的水墨画闻名。他花很长时间观察水中的虾，所以他的画看起来非常生动。他喜爱日常生活中简单的事物，并把它们变成艺术。他一直画到年老，几乎每天都画。他的故事告诉我们：勤奋和热爱可以让任何人成为艺术家。","search":"齐白石画虾 qi baishi and his shrimp qi baishi was one of the most famous painters in modern china. he was born in 1864 in a small village in hunan. he did not go to art school, and he learned to paint by himself. qi baishi was famous for his ink paintings of shrimp and flowers. he spent a long time watching shrimp in water, so his paintings look very alive. he loved simple things in everyday life and turned them into art. he painted almost every day until his old age. his story tells us that hard work and love can make anyone an artist."},{"id":"u3-b5","unit":3,"group":"B","index":10,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"我的同学，街角画家","enTitle":"My Classmate, the Wall Artist","words":"约93词","wordsApprox":93,"paragraphs":["My classmate Lin Tao loves to paint on walls. He is not a famous artist, but he is the best painter I know. He has painted many funny and beautiful pictures in our school.","Last term, he spent two weekends painting a big tree on the wall near our classroom. He finished the work just before the school art festival. Now everyone stops to look at it and say hello to him.","I think his dream is to make our city more colourful. I hope to visit his first real show one day."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我的同学林涛喜欢在墙上画画。他虽然不是著名艺术家，却是我认识的最好的画家。他在我们学校画过许多有趣又漂亮的画。上个学期，他花了两个周末在我们教室附近的墙上画了一棵大树。他刚好在学校艺术节前完成了这幅作品。现在每个人都会停下来看它，并和他打招呼。我认为他的梦想是让我们的城市更加色彩缤纷。我希望有一天能去参观他第一场真正的画展。","search":"我的同学，街角画家 my classmate, the wall artist my classmate lin tao loves to paint on walls. he is not a famous artist, but he is the best painter i know. he has painted many funny and beautiful pictures in our school. last term, he spent two weekends painting a big tree on the wall near our classroom. he finished the work just before the school art festival. now everyone stops to look at it and say hello to him. i think his dream is to make our city more colourful. i hope to visit his first real show one day."}]},{"no":4,"enName":"Reduce, Reuse, Recycle","cnName":"减量·再用·回收","grammar":"状语从句与宾语从句复习","task":"Write a post about an environmental concern（写环保话题帖子）","patterns":[{"en":"I'm writing this post to talk about an environmental problem in our school.","cn":"我写这篇帖子是想谈谈我们学校的一个环境问题。","usage":"帖子开头点明写作目的，I'm writing this post to... 后接不定式作目的状语，直接引出话题，是帖子类作文最常用的开头。","search":"i'm writing this post to talk about an environmental problem in our school. 我写这篇帖子是想谈谈我们学校的一个环境问题。 帖子开头点明写作目的，i'm writing this post to... 后接不定式作目的状语，直接引出话题，是帖子类作文最常用的开头。"},{"en":"When I walked past the school gate this morning, I saw lots of plastic bags on the ground.","cn":"今天早上我经过校门时，看到地上有很多塑料袋。","usage":"when 引导时间状语从句，用一般过去时叙述亲眼所见，让问题更真实可感，适合在帖子开头举例。","search":"when i walked past the school gate this morning, i saw lots of plastic bags on the ground. 今天早上我经过校门时，看到地上有很多塑料袋。 when 引导时间状语从句，用一般过去时叙述亲眼所见，让问题更真实可感，适合在帖子开头举例。"},{"en":"If we all bring our own water bottles, we will produce much less plastic waste.","cn":"如果我们都自带水杯，就能产生少得多的塑料垃圾。","usage":"if 引导条件状语从句，主句用一般将来时、从句用一般现在时（主将从现），用来提出可行的解决办法。","search":"if we all bring our own water bottles, we will produce much less plastic waste. 如果我们都自带水杯，就能产生少得多的塑料垃圾。 if 引导条件状语从句，主句用一般将来时、从句用一般现在时（主将从现），用来提出可行的解决办法。"},{"en":"Although it is easy to use paper cups, they are bad for the environment.","cn":"虽然纸杯用起来很方便，但它们对环境有害。","usage":"although 引导让步状语从句，先承认便利再指出问题，说理更客观；be bad for 表示“对……有害”。","search":"although it is easy to use paper cups, they are bad for the environment. 虽然纸杯用起来很方便，但它们对环境有害。 although 引导让步状语从句，先承认便利再指出问题，说理更客观；be bad for 表示“对……有害”。"},{"en":"We should take action now so that our city can be cleaner in the future.","cn":"我们应该现在就行动起来，这样我们的城市将来才能更干净。","usage":"so that 引导目的状语从句，表示“以便、以便于”，常用于帖子结尾发出号召。","search":"we should take action now so that our city can be cleaner in the future. 我们应该现在就行动起来，这样我们的城市将来才能更干净。 so that 引导目的状语从句，表示“以便、以便于”，常用于帖子结尾发出号召。"},{"en":"I believe that small changes can make a big difference.","cn":"我相信小小的改变也能带来很大的不同。","usage":"that 引导宾语从句，作 believe 的宾语；make a big difference 是“带来很大不同”的高频短语。","search":"i believe that small changes can make a big difference. 我相信小小的改变也能带来很大的不同。 that 引导宾语从句，作 believe 的宾语；make a big difference 是“带来很大不同”的高频短语。"},{"en":"I have noticed that many students throw away half of their lunch every day.","cn":"我注意到许多学生每天都会倒掉一半的午饭。","usage":"have noticed that... 用现在完成时引出观察到的现象，that 引导宾语从句，适合在提出问题时先摆事实。","search":"i have noticed that many students throw away half of their lunch every day. 我注意到许多学生每天都会倒掉一半的午饭。 have noticed that... 用现在完成时引出观察到的现象，that 引导宾语从句，适合在提出问题时先摆事实。"},{"en":"I hope that everyone can join us and help protect the earth.","cn":"我希望大家都能加入我们，一起保护地球。","usage":"hope that... 引导宾语从句，用于帖子结尾发出邀请；join us 表示“加入我们”。","search":"i hope that everyone can join us and help protect the earth. 我希望大家都能加入我们，一起保护地球。 hope that... 引导宾语从句，用于帖子结尾发出邀请；join us 表示“加入我们”。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u4-a1","unit":4,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"少用一个塑料袋","enTitle":"Say No to One More Plastic Bag","words":"约134词","wordsApprox":134,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post to talk about a serious problem in our school: plastic waste. When I walked past the school gate this morning, I saw lots of plastic bags, bottles and wrappers on the ground. They made our school look dirty and ugly.","I have noticed that many students buy drinks and snacks in plastic bags every day. After lunch, those bags are thrown away and end up in the river near our school. Although plastic bags are cheap and convenient, they stay in the earth for hundreds of years. That is really bad for animals and plants.","If we all bring our own cloth bags, we will use much fewer plastic bags. I believe that small changes can make a big difference. I hope that everyone can join us and start today."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 I'm writing this post to talk about... 直接点明帖子主题，When I walked past the school gate this morning 用 when 时间状语从句叙述亲眼所见，plastic bags, bottles and wrappers 罗列现象，让问题具体可信。2）第二段用 I have noticed that... 现在完成时加宾语从句摆出更多事实；Although plastic bags are cheap and convenient, they stay in the earth for hundreds of years 用 although 让步状语从句先承认便利、再指出危害，说理客观有力。3）结尾用 If we all bring our own cloth bags, we will use much fewer plastic bags 提出条件与解决办法（主将从现），再用 I believe that... 与 I hope that... 两个宾语从句表明态度、发出号召，结构完整。","highlight":"Although plastic bags are cheap and convenient, they stay in the earth for hundreds of years.","highlightCn":"虽然塑料袋便宜又方便，但它们会在地球上存留数百年。"},"translation":null,"search":"少用一个塑料袋 say no to one more plastic bag i'm writing this post to talk about a serious problem in our school: plastic waste. when i walked past the school gate this morning, i saw lots of plastic bags, bottles and wrappers on the ground. they made our school look dirty and ugly. i have noticed that many students buy drinks and snacks in plastic bags every day. after lunch, those bags are thrown away and end up in the river near our school. although plastic bags are cheap and convenient, they stay in the earth for hundreds of years. that is really bad for animals and plants. if we all bring our own cloth bags, we will use much fewer plastic bags. i believe that small changes can make a big difference. i hope that everyone can join us and start today."},{"id":"u4-a2","unit":4,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"让天空更蓝","enTitle":"Make Our Sky Blue Again","words":"约127词","wordsApprox":127,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post to talk about air pollution in our city. Last week, our science teacher told us that the air quality was “very bad” for three days. When I looked out of the window, I could not even see the hills far away.","Most of the pollution comes from cars and buses. If more people ride bikes or take the bus, there will be less smoke in the air. I believe that everyone can help. For example, my father now rides his bike to work twice a week, and he says he feels healthier too.","We should take action now so that our children can see blue skies and green trees. Let's start with one small choice: leave the car at home when we can."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头点明话题 air pollution，再用 Last week, our science teacher told us that... 转述老师的话，that 引导宾语从句；the air quality was “very bad” for three days 引用具体评价增强真实感。2）第二段先指出污染来源 Most of the pollution comes from cars and buses，再用 If more people ride bikes or take the bus, there will be less smoke in the air 提出条件与结果（主将从现）；my father now rides his bike to work twice a week 用身边的例子使建议更可信。3）结尾用 We should take action now so that... 引导目的状语从句发出号召，最后 Let's start with one small choice 把行动落到日常，语气亲切、有感染力。","highlight":"If more people ride bikes or take the bus, there will be less smoke in the air.","highlightCn":"如果更多人骑自行车或乘公交车，空气中的烟尘就会更少。"},"translation":null,"search":"让天空更蓝 make our sky blue again i'm writing this post to talk about air pollution in our city. last week, our science teacher told us that the air quality was “very bad” for three days. when i looked out of the window, i could not even see the hills far away. most of the pollution comes from cars and buses. if more people ride bikes or take the bus, there will be less smoke in the air. i believe that everyone can help. for example, my father now rides his bike to work twice a week, and he says he feels healthier too. we should take action now so that our children can see blue skies and green trees. let's start with one small choice: leave the car at home when we can."},{"id":"u4-a3","unit":4,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"别让午餐被倒掉","enTitle":"Don't Throw Away Your Lunch","words":"约127词","wordsApprox":127,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about food waste in our school dining hall. Yesterday at lunch, I saw that almost every table had a plate with half-eaten rice and vegetables. The workers told me that they throw away more than ten big bags of food every day.","I have noticed that many students take too much food because they are hungry, but then they cannot finish it. Although the food looks cheap, farmers work hard to grow it, and our parents pay for it. Throwing food away is not polite.","If we take only what we can eat, we will waste much less food. I believe that a clean plate is a small but important way to show our thanks. I hope that everyone can join us soon."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头点明 food waste in our school dining hall，接着用 Yesterday at lunch, I saw that... 宾语从句叙述所见，almost every table had a plate with half-eaten rice and vegetables 细节真实，more than ten big bags of food every day 用数字说明浪费之严重。2）第二段用 I have noticed that... 摆出现象，because they are hungry 回答“为什么拿太多”；Although the food looks cheap, farmers work hard to grow it 用 although 让步状语从句转折，说理有层次。3）结尾用 If we take only what we can eat, we will waste much less food 提出解决办法，I believe that a clean plate is... 与 I hope that everyone can join us 两个宾语从句把建议与号召结合起来，收束有力。","highlight":"If we take only what we can eat, we will waste much less food.","highlightCn":"如果我们只取自己能吃完的食物，就会浪费少得多的食物。"},"translation":null,"search":"别让午餐被倒掉 don't throw away your lunch i'm writing this post about food waste in our school dining hall. yesterday at lunch, i saw that almost every table had a plate with half-eaten rice and vegetables. the workers told me that they throw away more than ten big bags of food every day. i have noticed that many students take too much food because they are hungry, but then they cannot finish it. although the food looks cheap, farmers work hard to grow it, and our parents pay for it. throwing food away is not polite. if we take only what we can eat, we will waste much less food. i believe that a clean plate is a small but important way to show our thanks. i hope that everyone can join us soon."},{"id":"u4-a4","unit":4,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"珍惜每一滴水","enTitle":"Save Every Drop of Water","words":"约129词","wordsApprox":129,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post to talk about saving water. Our city has had little rain this year, and the water level in the river near my home is much lower than before. When I saw the dry riverbed, I knew that we must do something.","I have noticed that some students leave the taps running while they wash their hands. Others spend twenty minutes in the shower every day. Although water seems cheap, it is not endless. If we turn off the tap in time, we can save a lot of water every day.","I believe that saving water is everyone's duty. We should take action now so that our city will not run out of water. I hope that you can share more good ideas under this post."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 I'm writing this post to talk about saving water 点题，Our city has had little rain this year 与 the water level... is much lower than before 构成对比，When I saw the dry riverbed, I knew that... 用 when 时间状语从句把见闻与想法连接起来。2）第二段用 I have noticed that... 两个现在完成时宾语从句列举浪费现象：leave the taps running、spend twenty minutes in the shower；Although water seems cheap, it is not endless 用 although 让步状语从句点出“水并非取之不尽”，If we turn off the tap in time, we can save a lot of water 提出具体做法。3）结尾用 I believe that saving water is everyone's duty 表明观点，so that 目的状语从句说明行动目的，最后 I hope that you can share more good ideas 呼吁大家参与，互动感强。","highlight":"Although water seems cheap, it is not endless.","highlightCn":"虽然水看起来便宜，但并非取之不尽。"},"translation":null,"search":"珍惜每一滴水 save every drop of water i'm writing this post to talk about saving water. our city has had little rain this year, and the water level in the river near my home is much lower than before. when i saw the dry riverbed, i knew that we must do something. i have noticed that some students leave the taps running while they wash their hands. others spend twenty minutes in the shower every day. although water seems cheap, it is not endless. if we turn off the tap in time, we can save a lot of water every day. i believe that saving water is everyone's duty. we should take action now so that our city will not run out of water. i hope that you can share more good ideas under this post."},{"id":"u4-a5","unit":4,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"公园不是垃圾场","enTitle":"A Park Is Not a Dustbin","words":"约138词","wordsApprox":138,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about the litter problem in the park near our community. Last Sunday, I went there with my cousin. We were both surprised to see plastic bottles, paper and food boxes everywhere. Some children were playing football right next to a pile of rubbish.","I asked a worker in the park why there was so much rubbish. He said that some visitors forget to take their rubbish home, and the wind blows it everywhere. Although the park is cleaned every morning, it looks dirty again by the afternoon. I think we should do something about it.","This Saturday, our class will start a clean-up activity in the park. If you are free, please join us and bring a pair of gloves and a big bag. I believe that a clean park will make everyone happier."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头点明 the litter problem in the park near our community，Last Sunday, I went there with my cousin 交代时间与人物，We were both surprised to see... everywhere 描写所见，children were playing football right next to a pile of rubbish 用对比画面突出问题的严重。2）第二段用 I asked a worker... why... 引出原因，He said that some visitors forget to take their rubbish home, and the wind blows it everywhere 宾语从句与并列分句结合；Although the park is cleaned every morning, it looks dirty again by the afternoon 用 although 让步状语从句强调问题反复。3）结尾提出具体行动：This Saturday, our class will start a clean-up activity；If you are free, please join us and bring... 用条件状语从句发出邀请，I believe that a clean park will make everyone happier 用宾语从句收尾，号召力强。","highlight":"Although the park is cleaned every morning, it looks dirty again by the afternoon.","highlightCn":"虽然公园每天早上都打扫，但到了下午又变脏了。"},"translation":null,"search":"公园不是垃圾场 a park is not a dustbin i'm writing this post about the litter problem in the park near our community. last sunday, i went there with my cousin. we were both surprised to see plastic bottles, paper and food boxes everywhere. some children were playing football right next to a pile of rubbish. i asked a worker in the park why there was so much rubbish. he said that some visitors forget to take their rubbish home, and the wind blows it everywhere. although the park is cleaned every morning, it looks dirty again by the afternoon. i think we should do something about it. this saturday, our class will start a clean-up activity in the park. if you are free, please join us and bring a pair of gloves and a big bag. i believe that a clean park will make everyone happier."},{"id":"u4-b1","unit":4,"group":"B","index":6,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"加入我们的清洁小组","enTitle":"Join Our Clean-Up Group","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post to start a clean-up group in our community. Every Saturday afternoon, we can meet at the park gate and pick up rubbish for one hour. Please bring gloves and a big bag. We can also share some easy ways to recycle what we collect.","I believe that a clean community makes everyone feel better. If we all work together, our park will look beautiful again. I hope that you can join us this weekend. It will also be a good chance to make new friends."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我写这篇帖子是想在我们社区成立一个清洁小组。每周六下午，我们可以在公园门口集合，捡一个小时的垃圾。请带上手套和一个大袋子。我们还可以分享一些回收所捡物品的简单方法。我相信干净的环境会让每个人感觉更好。如果我们齐心协力，我们的公园会重新变得美丽。我希望你这个周末能加入我们。这也是结交新朋友的好机会。","search":"加入我们的清洁小组 join our clean-up group i'm writing this post to start a clean-up group in our community. every saturday afternoon, we can meet at the park gate and pick up rubbish for one hour. please bring gloves and a big bag. we can also share some easy ways to recycle what we collect. i believe that a clean community makes everyone feel better. if we all work together, our park will look beautiful again. i hope that you can join us this weekend. it will also be a good chance to make new friends."},{"id":"u4-b2","unit":4,"group":"B","index":7,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"自带布袋，少用塑料袋","enTitle":"Bring Your Own Cloth Bag","words":"约89词","wordsApprox":89,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about plastic bags. When I went shopping with my mother yesterday, we came home with six plastic bags. Most of them will be thrown away after one use. A cloth bag is cheap and strong, and it can be used for years.","Although plastic bags are convenient, they cause serious pollution. If we bring our own cloth bags, we can use fewer of them. I believe that this small change will make our city cleaner. Let's put a cloth bag in our school bag today."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我写这篇帖子是想谈谈塑料袋的问题。昨天我和妈妈去购物，回家时带回了六个塑料袋。它们大多用一次就会被扔掉。布袋便宜又结实，可以用好几年。虽然塑料袋很方便，但它们会造成严重的污染。如果我们自带布袋，就能少用很多塑料袋。我相信这个小小的改变会让我们的城市更干净。今天就在书包里放一个布袋吧。","search":"自带布袋，少用塑料袋 bring your own cloth bag i'm writing this post about plastic bags. when i went shopping with my mother yesterday, we came home with six plastic bags. most of them will be thrown away after one use. a cloth bag is cheap and strong, and it can be used for years. although plastic bags are convenient, they cause serious pollution. if we bring our own cloth bags, we can use fewer of them. i believe that this small change will make our city cleaner. let's put a cloth bag in our school bag today."},{"id":"u4-b3","unit":4,"group":"B","index":8,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"让纸张多用一次","enTitle":"Use Every Sheet of Paper Twice","words":"约92词","wordsApprox":92,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about paper waste in our classroom. Every day, we throw away a lot of paper. Many sheets have only one or two words on them. Our teacher told us that one tree can only make about 8,000 sheets of paper.","I have noticed that we often use a new sheet when we make a small mistake. If we use both sides of the paper, we will save many trees. I believe that we can also collect waste paper and recycle it. Let's start from the next exercise book."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我写这篇帖子是想谈谈我们教室里的纸张浪费。每天我们都会扔掉很多纸。许多纸片上只写了一两个字。老师告诉我们，一棵树大约只能造出 8000 张纸。我注意到我们常常因为写错一个小地方就换一张新纸。如果我们使用纸的两面，就能拯救许多树木。我相信我们还可以收集废纸并回收利用。让我们从下一本练习本开始吧。","search":"让纸张多用一次 use every sheet of paper twice i'm writing this post about paper waste in our classroom. every day, we throw away a lot of paper. many sheets have only one or two words on them. our teacher told us that one tree can only make about 8,000 sheets of paper. i have noticed that we often use a new sheet when we make a small mistake. if we use both sides of the paper, we will save many trees. i believe that we can also collect waste paper and recycle it. let's start from the next exercise book."},{"id":"u4-b4","unit":4,"group":"B","index":9,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"随手关灯，节约用电","enTitle":"Turn Off the Lights","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about saving electricity. When I walked past our classroom after school yesterday, the lights and the air conditioner were still on. Nobody was in the room.","I have noticed that this happens almost every day. Although it is easy to forget, turning off the lights can save a lot of energy. If everyone remembers to do it, our school will save money and help the earth at the same time. Let's check the lights before we leave the classroom."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我写这篇帖子是想谈谈节约用电。昨天放学后我经过教室时，灯和空调还开着，房间里一个人也没有。我注意到这几乎每天都会发生。虽然忘记关灯很容易，但关灯能节约很多能源。如果每个人都记得这样做，我们学校既能省钱，又能同时帮助地球。离开教室前，让我们检查一下灯吧。","search":"随手关灯，节约用电 turn off the lights i'm writing this post about saving electricity. when i walked past our classroom after school yesterday, the lights and the air conditioner were still on. nobody was in the room. i have noticed that this happens almost every day. although it is easy to forget, turning off the lights can save a lot of energy. if everyone remembers to do it, our school will save money and help the earth at the same time. let's check the lights before we leave the classroom."},{"id":"u4-b5","unit":4,"group":"B","index":10,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"为社区种一棵树","enTitle":"Plant a Tree for Our Community","words":"约88词","wordsApprox":88,"paragraphs":["I'm writing this post about our community garden. Last month, some workers cut down two old trees because they were ill. Now the garden looks empty and hot. The children have no place to play in summer.","I believe that planting trees is a good way to make our community greener. Trees can give us shade and clean the air. If we plant one small tree together this spring, it will grow with us for many years. I hope that you can join us on Tree Planting Day."],"analysis":null,"translation":"我写这篇帖子是想谈谈我们社区的花园。上个月，一些工人因为两棵老树生病把它们砍掉了。现在花园看起来空荡荡的，也很热。孩子们夏天没有地方玩。我相信种树是让社区更绿的好办法。树木能给我们阴凉，还能净化空气。如果今年春天我们一起种一棵小树，它会陪伴我们生长很多年。我希望你能在植树节加入我们。","search":"为社区种一棵树 plant a tree for our community i'm writing this post about our community garden. last month, some workers cut down two old trees because they were ill. now the garden looks empty and hot. the children have no place to play in summer. i believe that planting trees is a good way to make our community greener. trees can give us shade and clean the air. if we plant one small tree together this spring, it will grow with us for many years. i hope that you can join us on tree planting day."}]},{"no":5,"enName":"Open to New Beginnings","cnName":"迈向新起点","grammar":"时态复习：一般现在时、一般过去时、一般将来时、现在完成时","task":"Write a graduation speech（写毕业演讲稿）","patterns":[{"en":"Good morning, everyone! It is my great honour to speak here today.","cn":"大家早上好！今天我很荣幸在这里发言。","usage":"演讲稿开头先问候听众，再用 It is my great honour to do sth. 表达荣幸，正式而得体。","search":"good morning, everyone! it is my great honour to speak here today. 大家早上好！今天我很荣幸在这里发言。 演讲稿开头先问候听众，再用 it is my great honour to do sth. 表达荣幸，正式而得体。"},{"en":"Over the past three years, we have learned and grown together.","cn":"三年来，我们一起学习、一起成长。","usage":"现在完成时 have learned and grown 与 over the past three years 连用，概括从过去到现在的经历，适合回顾三年时光。","search":"over the past three years, we have learned and grown together. 三年来，我们一起学习、一起成长。 现在完成时 have learned and grown 与 over the past three years 连用，概括从过去到现在的经历，适合回顾三年时光。"},{"en":"I still remember the first day when I walked into this school.","cn":"我仍然记得我走进这所学校的第一天。","usage":"一般过去时引出回忆；when 引导定语从句，把听众带回具体场景，是演讲中唤起共鸣的常用句式。","search":"i still remember the first day when i walked into this school. 我仍然记得我走进这所学校的第一天。 一般过去时引出回忆；when 引导定语从句，把听众带回具体场景，是演讲中唤起共鸣的常用句式。"},{"en":"You have always been patient with us and have helped us in many ways.","cn":"您一直对我们很有耐心，并在很多方面帮助我们。","usage":"现在完成时 have been / have helped 表达从过去延续到现在的状态与行为，适合向老师表达感谢。","search":"you have always been patient with us and have helped us in many ways. 您一直对我们很有耐心，并在很多方面帮助我们。 现在完成时 have been / have helped 表达从过去延续到现在的状态与行为，适合向老师表达感谢。"},{"en":"In the future, I will face new challenges with courage and confidence.","cn":"将来，我会带着勇气和信心面对新的挑战。","usage":"一般将来时 will face 表达对未来的决心；with courage and confidence 是常用的状语短语。","search":"in the future, i will face new challenges with courage and confidence. 将来，我会带着勇气和信心面对新的挑战。 一般将来时 will face 表达对未来的决心；with courage and confidence 是常用的状语短语。"},{"en":"We will always be friends, no matter where we go.","cn":"无论我们走到哪里，我们永远都是朋友。","usage":"no matter where 引导让步状语从句，常放在句末，用来表达深厚的同学情谊。","search":"we will always be friends, no matter where we go. 无论我们走到哪里，我们永远都是朋友。 no matter where 引导让步状语从句，常放在句末，用来表达深厚的同学情谊。"},{"en":"Thank you for everything you have done for us.","cn":"谢谢您为我们所做的一切。","usage":"Thank you for + 名词/动名词，后接省略关系词的定语从句，是演讲稿致谢环节的万能句。","search":"thank you for everything you have done for us. 谢谢您为我们所做的一切。 thank you for + 名词/动名词，后接省略关系词的定语从句，是演讲稿致谢环节的万能句。"},{"en":"Let's open our hearts to new beginnings and work hard for our dreams.","cn":"让我们敞开胸怀迎接新的开始，为梦想而努力。","usage":"Let's do sth. 提出号召，适合放在演讲结尾；open our hearts to... 表示“以开放的心态迎接……”。","search":"let's open our hearts to new beginnings and work hard for our dreams. 让我们敞开胸怀迎接新的开始，为梦想而努力。 let's do sth. 提出号召，适合放在演讲结尾；open our hearts to... 表示“以开放的心态迎接……”。"}],"essays":[{"id":"u5-a1","unit":5,"group":"A","index":1,"label":"范文一","cnTitle":"毕业典礼上的发言","enTitle":"A Speech at the Graduation Ceremony","words":"约142词","wordsApprox":142,"paragraphs":["Good morning, dear teachers and classmates! It is my great honour to speak here today. Over the past three years, we have learned and grown together. I still remember the first day when I walked into this school. Everything was new and a little scary, but your smiles made me feel at home.","I want to thank our teachers. You have always been patient with us and have helped us in many ways. When we were tired, you encouraged us to keep going. We have learned not only knowledge but also how to be kind and brave.","Now we are leaving for senior high school. In the future, I will face new challenges with courage and confidence. We will always be friends, no matter where we go. Let's open our hearts to new beginnings and work hard for our dreams. Thank you!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头先用 Good morning, dear teachers and classmates! 问候听众，It is my great honour to speak here today 用固定句型表达荣幸，Over the past three years, we have learned and grown together 用现在完成时概括三年时光，符合演讲稿的开场习惯。2）主体转入回忆与感谢：I still remember the first day when I walked into this school 用一般过去时和 when 定语从句带回初入校园的场景，Everything was new and a little scary, but your smiles made me feel at home 用 but 构成对比；You have always been patient with us、When we were tired, you encouraged us to keep going 交替使用现在完成时与一般过去时，把感谢写得具体动人。3）结尾展望未来：In the future, I will face new challenges with courage and confidence 用一般将来时表明决心，no matter where we go 表达同学情谊，最后 Let's open our hearts to new beginnings 呼应标题、发出号召，收束有力。","highlight":"Let's open our hearts to new beginnings and work hard for our dreams.","highlightCn":"让我们敞开胸怀迎接新的开始，为梦想而努力。"},"translation":null,"search":"毕业典礼上的发言 a speech at the graduation ceremony good morning, dear teachers and classmates! it is my great honour to speak here today. over the past three years, we have learned and grown together. i still remember the first day when i walked into this school. everything was new and a little scary, but your smiles made me feel at home. i want to thank our teachers. you have always been patient with us and have helped us in many ways. when we were tired, you encouraged us to keep going. we have learned not only knowledge but also how to be kind and brave. now we are leaving for senior high school. in the future, i will face new challenges with courage and confidence. we will always be friends, no matter where we go. let's open our hearts to new beginnings and work hard for our dreams. thank you!"},{"id":"u5-a2","unit":5,"group":"A","index":2,"label":"范文二","cnTitle":"致老师的毕业感谢词","enTitle":"A Thank-You Speech to Our Teachers","words":"约124词","wordsApprox":124,"paragraphs":["Dear teachers, good afternoon! On this special day, I would like to say thank you on behalf of all the students. Over the past three years, you have done so much for us. You came to school early and went home late. You corrected our homework carefully and never gave up on anyone.","I still remember the day when I failed a test. You did not blame me. Instead, you sat down with me and told me to believe in myself. Because of you, I have become more confident and hard-working.","In the future, I will try my best to make you proud. We will never forget your lessons. Thank you for everything you have done for us. We wish you health and happiness!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Dear teachers, good afternoon! 称呼听众，On this special day, I would like to say thank you on behalf of all the students 说明发言的场合与身份，Over the past three years, you have done so much for us 用现在完成时总起感谢。2）第二段用一般过去时的具体回忆支撑感谢：You came to school early and went home late、You corrected our homework carefully 写老师日常付出；I still remember the day when I failed a test 用 when 定语从句引出往事，You did not blame me. Instead, you sat down with me and told me to believe in myself 中不定式作宾语补足语，写出老师的鼓励。3）结尾用 In the future, I will try my best to make you proud 把感恩转化为行动，Thank you for everything you have done 再次致谢，We wish you health and happiness 以祝福收尾，情感真挚、结构完整。","highlight":"Because of you, I have become more confident and hard-working.","highlightCn":"因为您，我变得更加自信、更加努力。"},"translation":null,"search":"致老师的毕业感谢词 a thank-you speech to our teachers dear teachers, good afternoon! on this special day, i would like to say thank you on behalf of all the students. over the past three years, you have done so much for us. you came to school early and went home late. you corrected our homework carefully and never gave up on anyone. i still remember the day when i failed a test. you did not blame me. instead, you sat down with me and told me to believe in myself. because of you, i have become more confident and hard-working. in the future, i will try my best to make you proud. we will never forget your lessons. thank you for everything you have done for us. we wish you health and happiness!"},{"id":"u5-a3","unit":5,"group":"A","index":3,"label":"范文三","cnTitle":"友谊不毕业","enTitle":"Friendship Does Not Graduate","words":"约129词","wordsApprox":129,"paragraphs":["Good evening, my dear friends! Tonight we are here to say goodbye to our junior high school life. Over the past three years, we have shared so many happy and sad moments. Do you still remember the first school trip? We sang songs on the bus and laughed all the way.","When I was sad, you sat with me and listened to me. When I was proud, you reminded me to stay calm. We studied together in the library and played basketball together after class. These small things have made our friendship strong.","Next month, we will go to different senior high schools. We will always be friends, no matter where we go. Let's keep in touch and meet again soon. I hope that our friendship will last forever."],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Good evening, my dear friends! 营造亲切氛围，Tonight we are here to say goodbye to our junior high school life 点明演讲场合，Over the past three years, we have shared so many happy and sad moments 用现在完成时总括三年友情。2）主体用 Do you still remember...? 和 When I was sad... 的具体场景唤起共同回忆：We sang songs on the bus and laughed all the way 写校车出游的欢乐；When I was sad, you sat with me and listened to me 与 When I was proud, you reminded me to stay calm 构成对照，句式整齐；These small things have made our friendship strong 用现在完成时总结友情。3）结尾用 Next month, we will go to different senior high schools 交代离别，no matter where we go 表达不变的友谊，Let's keep in touch 和 I hope that our friendship will last forever 把祝愿与号召结合，收束温暖有力。","highlight":"We studied together in the library and played basketball together after class.","highlightCn":"我们一起在图书馆学习，课后一起打篮球。"},"translation":null,"search":"友谊不毕业 friendship does not graduate good evening, my dear friends! tonight we are here to say goodbye to our junior high school life. over the past three years, we have shared so many happy and sad moments. do you still remember the first school trip? we sang songs on the bus and laughed all the way. when i was sad, you sat with me and listened to me. when i was proud, you reminded me to stay calm. we studied together in the library and played basketball together after class. these small things have made our friendship strong. next month, we will go to different senior high schools. we will always be friends, no matter where we go. let's keep in touch and meet again soon. i hope that our friendship will last forever."},{"id":"u5-a4","unit":5,"group":"A","index":4,"label":"范文四","cnTitle":"带着梦想出发","enTitle":"Setting Out with Our Dreams","words":"约128词","wordsApprox":128,"paragraphs":["Dear teachers and classmates, good morning! Today is a special day for all of us. Over the past three years, we have learned to think, to ask questions and to help each other. We are no longer shy children. We are ready for the future.","I have a dream. I want to become a doctor and help sick people. Some of you want to be teachers, engineers or writers. Our dreams are different, but they all need hard work. If we keep learning and never give up, we will make our dreams come true.","In the future, I will face new challenges with courage. I will remember the happy days we spent together. Thank you, my dear teachers and friends. Let's work hard and meet at the top!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Dear teachers and classmates, good morning! 问候听众，Today is a special day for all of us 点明毕业日；Over the past three years, we have learned to think, to ask questions and to help each other 用现在完成时和三个并列不定式概括成长，We are no longer shy children. We are ready for the future 用一般现在时收束第一段，节奏明快。2）第二段写梦想：I have a dream. I want to become a doctor and help sick people 用现在完成时与 want to do 表达志向，Some of you want to be teachers, engineers or writers 用并列名词展示不同的梦；If we keep learning and never give up, we will make our dreams come true 用 if 条件状语从句把梦想与努力联系起来（主将从现）。3）结尾用 In the future, I will face new challenges with courage 与 I will remember the happy days 两个一般将来时句子展望未来、珍藏回忆，最后 Let's work hard and meet at the top 以号召收尾，富有感染力。","highlight":"If we keep learning and never give up, we will make our dreams come true.","highlightCn":"如果我们坚持学习、永不放弃，就一定能实现梦想。"},"translation":null,"search":"带着梦想出发 setting out with our dreams dear teachers and classmates, good morning! today is a special day for all of us. over the past three years, we have learned to think, to ask questions and to help each other. we are no longer shy children. we are ready for the future. i have a dream. i want to become a doctor and help sick people. some of you want to be teachers, engineers or writers. our dreams are different, but they all need hard work. if we keep learning and never give up, we will make our dreams come true. in the future, i will face new challenges with courage. i will remember the happy days we spent together. thank you, my dear teachers and friends. let's work hard and meet at the top!"},{"id":"u5-a5","unit":5,"group":"A","index":5,"label":"范文五","cnTitle":"最后一节班会上的演讲","enTitle":"A Speech at Our Last Class Meeting","words":"约123词","wordsApprox":123,"paragraphs":["Good afternoon, everyone! Thank you for coming to our last class meeting. Over the past three years, we have spent more time together than with our families. We have had fights, but we have also had many wonderful moments.","I still remember our first sports meeting. Our class was small and not very strong, but everyone ran and cheered. When we won the relay race, the whole class jumped and shouted. That day, I learned that teamwork is the most important thing.","Now we will leave this classroom and start a new life. In the future, I will remember every one of you. Let's say thank you to our teachers and say goodbye to our old selves. Open your hearts to new beginnings!"],"analysis":{"text":"1）开头用 Good afternoon, everyone! Thank you for coming to our last class meeting 交代场合并感谢同学到场；Over the past three years, we have spent more time together than with our families 用现在完成时与比较级写出同学间的亲密，We have had fights, but we have also had many wonderful moments 用 but 让表达更真实。2）主体回忆第一次运动会：Our class was small and not very strong, but everyone ran and cheered 用一般过去时叙述，When we won the relay race, the whole class jumped and shouted 用 when 时间状语从句描写激动场面；That day, I learned that teamwork is the most important thing 用 that 宾语从句点明收获。3）结尾用 Now we will leave this classroom and start a new life 与 In the future, I will remember every one of you 两句形成今昔对照，Let's say thank you to our teachers and say goodbye to our old selves 用并列祈使句表达告别，最后 Open your hearts to new beginnings 呼应主题，简洁有力。","highlight":"That day, I learned that teamwork is the most important thing.","highlightCn":"那一天，我明白了团队合作才是最重要的。"},"translation":null,"search":"最后一节班会上的演讲 a speech at our last class meeting good afternoon, everyone! thank you for coming to our last class meeting. over the past three years, we have spent more time together than with our families. we have had fights, but we have also had many wonderful moments. i still remember our first sports meeting. our class was small and not very strong, but everyone ran and cheered. when we won the relay race, the whole class jumped and shouted. that day, i learned that teamwork is the most important thing. now we will leave this classroom and start a new life. in the future, i will remember every one of you. let's say thank you to our teachers and say goodbye to our old selves. open your hearts to new beginnings!"},{"id":"u5-b1","unit":5,"group":"B","index":6,"label":"范文六","cnTitle":"简短毕业发言","enTitle":"A Short Graduation Speech","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Good morning, dear teachers and classmates! It is my great honour to speak here. Over the past three years, we have learned and grown together. When we were tired, you always encouraged us to keep going. Thank you, teachers, for your help.","Now we are ready for a new beginning. In the future, I will work hard and face challenges with courage. We will always be friends. I hope that our dreams will come true one day. Good luck to everyone! Thank you!"],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家早上好，亲爱的老师和同学们！今天我很荣幸在这里发言。三年来，我们一起学习、一起成长。当我们疲惫时，你们总是鼓励我们坚持下去。谢谢老师们的帮助。现在我们已准备好迎接新的开始。将来，我会努力学习，带着勇气面对挑战。我们将永远是朋友。我希望有一天我们的梦想都能实现。祝大家好运！谢谢！","search":"简短毕业发言 a short graduation speech good morning, dear teachers and classmates! it is my great honour to speak here. over the past three years, we have learned and grown together. when we were tired, you always encouraged us to keep going. thank you, teachers, for your help. now we are ready for a new beginning. in the future, i will work hard and face challenges with courage. we will always be friends. i hope that our dreams will come true one day. good luck to everyone! thank you!"},{"id":"u5-b2","unit":5,"group":"B","index":7,"label":"范文七","cnTitle":"感谢你们","enTitle":"Thank You, My Parents and Teachers","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Dear parents and teachers, good evening! Thank you for coming to our graduation ceremony. Over the past three years, you have given us love and support every day. You came to every parents' meeting and cheered for us at our sports meetings. Thank you for everything you have done for us.","We still remember your warm words when we were tired. In the future, we will study hard and make you proud. We will always love you. We wish you health and happiness!"],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的爸爸妈妈、老师们，晚上好！感谢你们来参加我们的毕业典礼。三年来，你们每天都给予我们关爱和支持。你们参加了每一次家长会，在每一次运动会上为我们加油。谢谢你们为我们所做的一切。我们仍然记得疲惫时你们温暖的话语。将来，我们会努力学习，让你们骄傲。我们会永远爱你们。祝你们健康快乐！","search":"感谢你们 thank you, my parents and teachers dear parents and teachers, good evening! thank you for coming to our graduation ceremony. over the past three years, you have given us love and support every day. you came to every parents' meeting and cheered for us at our sports meetings. thank you for everything you have done for us. we still remember your warm words when we were tired. in the future, we will study hard and make you proud. we will always love you. we wish you health and happiness!"},{"id":"u5-b3","unit":5,"group":"B","index":8,"label":"范文八","cnTitle":"友谊长存","enTitle":"Friendship Forever","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Good afternoon, my dear friends! Today we say goodbye to our junior high school. Over the past three years, we have laughed and cried together. You have made my school life colourful and warm.","I still remember the day when we first met. You were so friendly that I soon felt at home. In the future, we will go to different schools, but we will always be friends. Let's keep in touch! Thank you for being my friends! I will never forget you."],"analysis":null,"translation":"下午好，我亲爱的朋友们！今天我们就要和初中生活说再见了。三年来，我们一起笑过、哭过。你们让我的校园生活多彩而温暖。我仍然记得我们第一次见面的那天。你们那么友好，让我很快就有了家的感觉。将来，我们会去不同的学校，但我们永远是朋友。让我们保持联系！谢谢你们做我的朋友！我永远不会忘记你们。","search":"友谊长存 friendship forever good afternoon, my dear friends! today we say goodbye to our junior high school. over the past three years, we have laughed and cried together. you have made my school life colourful and warm. i still remember the day when we first met. you were so friendly that i soon felt at home. in the future, we will go to different schools, but we will always be friends. let's keep in touch! thank you for being my friends! i will never forget you."},{"id":"u5-b4","unit":5,"group":"B","index":9,"label":"范文九","cnTitle":"向未来出发","enTitle":"Off to the Future","words":"约83词","wordsApprox":83,"paragraphs":["Good morning, everyone! Today is our graduation day. Over the past three years, we have worked hard and grown up. Now we are ready for senior high school. Thank you, dear teachers, for teaching us patiently and kindly.","In the future, I will study harder and try new things. I will not be afraid of difficulties. I believe that our dreams will come true if we never give up. We will always remember this school. Let's all open our hearts to new beginnings!"],"analysis":null,"translation":"大家早上好！今天是我们的毕业日。三年来，我们努力学习、不断成长。现在我们已准备好进入高中。谢谢亲爱的老师们耐心而友善地教导我们。将来，我会更加努力学习，尝试新事物。我不会害怕困难。我相信，只要我们永不放弃，梦想就一定会实现。我们会永远记住这所学校。让我们敞开胸怀迎接新的开始！","search":"向未来出发 off to the future good morning, everyone! today is our graduation day. over the past three years, we have worked hard and grown up. now we are ready for senior high school. thank you, dear teachers, for teaching us patiently and kindly. in the future, i will study harder and try new things. i will not be afraid of difficulties. i believe that our dreams will come true if we never give up. we will always remember this school. let's all open our hearts to new beginnings!"},{"id":"u5-b5","unit":5,"group":"B","index":10,"label":"范文十","cnTitle":"向老师道别","enTitle":"Goodbye, Dear Teachers","words":"约81词","wordsApprox":81,"paragraphs":["Dear teachers, good morning! Today we are leaving school. Over the past three years, you have taught us knowledge and kindness. You always came to school earlier than us. We will never forget your smiles and your warm words.","When we made mistakes, you helped us patiently. When we were sad, you listened to us. In the future, we will work hard and make you proud. Thank you for everything you have done for us! We wish you health and happiness!"],"analysis":null,"translation":"亲爱的老师们，早上好！今天我们就要离开学校了。三年来，你们教会我们知识和善良。你们总是比我们更早到校。我们永远不会忘记你们的笑容和温暖的话语。当我们犯错时，你们耐心地帮助我们。当我们难过时，你们倾听我们的心声。将来，我们会努力学习，让你们骄傲。谢谢你们为我们所做的一切！祝你们健康快乐！","search":"向老师道别 goodbye, dear teachers dear teachers, good morning! today we are leaving school. over the past three years, you have taught us knowledge and kindness. you always came to school earlier than us. we will never forget your smiles and your warm words. when we made mistakes, you helped us patiently. when we were sad, you listened to us. in the future, we will work hard and make you proud. thank you for everything you have done for us! we wish you health and happiness!"}]}]};
